			"notes": "## 0.2.0\n\nThis update improves Shift+Click behavior and adds configurable offhand refill scope.\n\n### Changed\n\nShift+Click refill can now be configured with three modes:\n\n- **Player Inventory Only** - default\n- **All Containers**\n- **Disabled**\n\n`Player Inventory Only` keeps the mod focused on the player's normal inventory while leaving containers, crafting tables, furnaces, and other menus to vanilla behavior.\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Shift+Clicking items from the player inventory into a container no longer redirects them into the offhand\n- crafting result stacks are no longer refilled one item at a time\n- container transfer direction is now respected when using `All Containers`\n\n### Config\n\nA simple built-in configuration screen is now available.\n\n**Fabric**\n- optional Mod Menu integration\n- Mod Menu is not required to use the mod\n\n**Forge / NeoForge**\n- configuration is available through the normal Mods -> Config screen\n\nChanges apply immediately without restarting the game.\n\nThe existing F-key refill behavior is unchanged.\n\n### Supported\n\n- Minecraft 26.2 / 1.20.1\n- Fabric\n- Forge\n- NeoForge"
		},
